  "name": "Toko",
  "type": "custom",
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "author": "Snozxyx",
  "description": "The official all-in-one Tatakai extension. Primary streaming via Nebula (AniList-keyed, direct HLS), plus anime direct streaming (Animepahe, Anikoto, Anizone, Animeya, Toonstream, Reanime, Aniworld, 4Anime, Animelok, Animesalt, Animeheaven, AnimeBLkom, DesiDub, Shahiid, AniPM, AnimeXin, FireAni, TurkAnime, 1Anime, Mkissa, Senshi), movie/TV streaming via MovieBox, torrent discovery (Nyaa, Animetosho, SubPlease, Seadex, nekoBT, AniLiberty), and manga reading (MangaDex, Comick, Mangapill, Mangakatana, Weebcentral, Nelomanga, Atsu, Webtoons, DemonicScans, ToonGod, Toonily, OniSaga, Mgeko, Scans.gg, LeerCapitulo, NovelCool).",
